notes: Axel is 31. Nine years without seeing each other; his brother Ben died two years ago and Kofi was not there. Real: the gap, Ben, the visit. Invented: the card.

TITLE New York, 2038 | One in the morning
PAUSE 4
KOFI: This sofa is a crime.
YOU: It was free.
KOFI (smile): I can tell.
PAUSE 4
YOU: Nine years.
KOFI (shut): Don't.
YOU: I'm only saying the number. [1.5]
PAUSE 5
KOFI (sad): I should have come when Ben died. [2.5]
PAUSE 3
YOU: You sent a card.
KOFI (sad): I sent a card. [2]
KOFI: I wrote four. That was the worst one. The good ones were too much, so I threw them away. [2]
YOU (sad): I kept it.
PAUSE 5
YOU: I stopped calling first. If we're counting.
KOFI: We're not counting. [2]
PAUSE 5
KOFI: Is there anything to eat in this city at one in the morning?
YOU (smile): There is everything to eat in this city at one in the morning. [1.5]
PAUSE 3
